    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Chapter 3 systematically outlines the physical and environmental geography of Andhra Pradesh.",
        "Physical geography covers location, extent, and physiographic divisions.",
        "Water resources are categorized into river systems and key irrigation projects.",
        "Regional environmental geography incorporates climate, forests, and wildlife distributions.",
        "Administrative geography covers the distribution and study of Andhra Pradesh districts."
